{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（12日）清晨6時左右，荃灣楊屋道街巿對開、往葵涌方向快線爆鹹水管，導致一段路面封閉。</p><p>現場可見快線有水湧出，水務署人員正在場處理。</p><figure><img alt=\"荃灣楊屋道街巿對開快線爆鹹水管，一段路面封閉。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164127967312482304301982.jpeg/zdTWfE39qO9zfsESbES3yNLutNMduWZkeSnl9nkp5fY\"/><figcaption>荃灣楊屋道街巿對開快線爆鹹水管，一段路面封閉。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"荃灣楊屋道街巿對開快線爆鹹水管，一段路面封閉。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164127964602830848970123.jpeg/I0eCQRWylLTlYBBX3GcrLBwBUH2T-y61ZyfjmGcn45g\"/><figcaption>荃灣楊屋道街巿對開快線爆鹹水管，一段路面封閉。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊屋道往葵涌方向有地底水管爆裂。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164128143053688832281037.jpeg/MB-yxHsib9pkr3VG2YE16YGJW1leU5qM99gkSPfYJEg\"/><figcaption>楊屋道往葵涌方向有地底水管爆裂。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊屋道往葵涌方向有地底水管爆裂。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164128145977249792671983.jpeg/-irb0oXhc0ryJ_kJPVmRSDt-c7vjnpffyYM0qcmDNKk\"/><figcaption>楊屋道往葵涌方向有地底水管爆裂。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊屋道往葵涌方向有地底水管爆裂。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164128148506546176615029.jpeg/CMTJlpK16QQjWG9ZoLCuJ3peXdpWr1_ANa2HljWth5Y\"/><figcaption>楊屋道往葵涌方向有地底水管爆裂。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊屋道往葵涌方向有地底水管爆裂。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164128151237169152752436.jpeg/g9PCmJyYoRHDu4n4_GbAbIEhGa5Y1-wAAjiRRgI4kUY\"/><figcaption>楊屋道往葵涌方向有地底水管爆裂。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T01:00:07.810494+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}